  "description": "A lightweight, robust, and type-safe \"Rust-Like\" Result type for C#/.NET projects, promoting explicit error handling and reliable code. Designed to elegantly manage operation outcomes without relying on exceptions for control flow.",
  "id": "TomRR.Core.ResultType",
